From: Val Packett <val@packett.cool>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 02:13:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/11] drm/msm/a6xx: Fix GMEM range on a680

On a680, the GMEM range starts at 0, like on newer generations.
Trying to use the 1M value results in texture corruption in Vulkan.
Fix the wrong range by introducing checks specific to this model.

Link: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/work_items/15349
Fixes: 4b565ca5a2cb ("drm/msm: Add A6XX device support")
Signed-off-by: Val Packett <val@packett.cool>

---
Note from the original posting (below the scissors line there):
  I have tried adding it to the if (!(..)) condition i.e. not
  touching the REG_A6XX_UCHE_GMEM_RANGE_* at all -- that just
  made launching gtk4-demo instantly hang the system.. So the only
  thing that works and solves the issue is actually writing the zero
  for the start.

6.18.60 adaptation: 6.18.60 has no adreno_is_a722()/A722 support, so the
16M case stays a740-family-only (behaviour for every existing GPU is
unchanged). 6.18.60 expresses MSM_PARAM_GMEM_BASE with
adreno_is_a650_family()/adreno_is_a740_family() rather than the newer
family >= ADRENO_6XX_GEN3 test, so adreno_is_a680() is added to the
zero-base condition. Upstream posting:
https://patchew.org/linux/20261103011358.65398-1-val@packett.cool/

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gpu.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gpu.c
index a4d752de9bbabaf0937f4904041c0f48531fe826..110184722cf142a7f31eaac8bfcd821e5229080d 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gpu.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gpu.c
@@ -1267,7 +1267,11 @@ static int hw_init(struct msm_gpu *gpu)
 	if (!(adreno_is_a650_family(adreno_gpu) ||
 	      adreno_is_a702(adreno_gpu) ||
 	      adreno_is_a730(adreno_gpu))) {
-		gmem_range_min = adreno_is_a740_family(adreno_gpu) ? SZ_16M : SZ_1M;
+		gmem_range_min = SZ_1M;
+		if (adreno_is_a740_family(adreno_gpu))
+			gmem_range_min = SZ_16M;
+		else if (adreno_is_a680(adreno_gpu))
+			gmem_range_min = 0;
 
 		/* Set the GMEM VA range [0x100000:0x100000 + gpu->gmem - 1] */
 		gpu_write64(gpu, REG_A6XX_UCHE_GMEM_RANGE_MIN, gmem_range_min);
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_gpu.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_gpu.c
index ef9798492bceef29ff72a90232c7d33e9bb9ca26..93dfc7f7c02744907262a8d8224092f7b2999e3b 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_gpu.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_gpu.c
@@ -369,7 +369,8 @@ int adreno_get_param(struct msm_gpu *gpu, struct msm_context *ctx,
 		return 0;
 	case MSM_PARAM_GMEM_BASE:
 		if (adreno_is_a650_family(adreno_gpu) ||
-		    adreno_is_a740_family(adreno_gpu))
+		    adreno_is_a740_family(adreno_gpu) ||
+		    adreno_is_a680(adreno_gpu))
 			*value = 0;
 		else
 			*value = 0x100000;
